Date:   Sat Aug 1 09:03:03 2026 -0400

    Fold third-party transfer onto the download drivers (Phase 4).
    
      crossload_dir_internal was a bespoke remote-to-remote walk. Replace it
      with tp_sink over the existing download drivers: the driver enumerates
      the origin with conn = from, the sink writes to `to`. make_dir creates
      the destination dir and defers its setstat, xfer_file crossloads a file.
      The origin uses discover-tree when available, else the readdir fallback.
      Directory setstat moves from inline to deferred, applied at end of walk.

