commit fd8b878fb67890bb27e54269468caf45d3d720d1
Author: Chris Rapier <rapier@psc.edu>
Date:   Thu Jul 9 11:45:51 2026 -0400

    hpn-status-frame: add FILEFAIL frame; use PEEK/POKE accessors
    
      New HPNS_T_FILEFAIL frame carries one failed file per frame (kind +
      opaque length-bounded path) for structured per-file failure reporting
      to a GUI. The path stays opaque to the parser and is neutralized at the
      render boundary; decode is strict, the encoder clamps to the payload cap.
    
      Also replace the hand-rolled hpns_put_u*/hpns_get_u* with OpenSSH's
      PEEK_U*/POKE_U* macros (sshbuf.h) - identical big-endian ops; as macros
      they add no symbols, so the object still links standalone for the fuzzer.

