    Add hpn3scp launcher skeleton; share the -R status runner
    
      Stage 0 of the B-side third-party transfer launcher (hpn3scp), which
      orchestrates direct A->C copies over the shipped hpnscp -R transport.
    
      Extract the launch/parse/passthrough/reap loop from scp.c's
